<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Registration | TEDxGIIS Youth</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,100..1000;1,9..40,100..1000&family=Inter:ital,opsz,wght@0,14..32,100..900;1,14..32,100..900&display=swap');
        body, html { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #000; color: #fff; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; margin: 0; }
        p { color: #d7d7d7; line-height: 1.6; }
        .nav { background: rgba(0,0,0,.85); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); width: 100%; min-height: 3.8em; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: .5em 1em; box-sizing: border-box; position: fixed; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
        #logopng { height: 2.6em; }
        .nav-right { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; overflow-x: auto; max-width: 75vw; }
        .ciclk { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: .7rem .95rem; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; }
        .ciclk::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 4px; background: transparent; transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left; transition: transform .18s ease, background-color .18s ease; }
        .ciclk:hover::before, .ciclk.active::before { background: #EB0028; transform: scaleX(1); }
        .page { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 6.2em 1.1em 2.5em; }
        .hero { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius: 18px; background: linear-gradient(145deg, #151515, #090909); padding: 2em; }
        .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.1em, 5vw, 3.4em); }
        .layout { margin-top: 2em; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1em; }
        .info-card { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1a1a1a, #0a0a0a); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.2em; }
        .info-card h2 { color: #EB0028; font-size: 1.25em; margin-bottom: .5em; }
        .note { margin-top: 1.5em; border-left: 4px solid #EB0028; padding-left: .9em; color: #f2f2f2; }
        footer { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); margin-top: 2.5em; padding-top: 1.2em; color: #8e8e8e; font-size: .9em; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav { padding: .5em; }
            #logopng { height: 2.2em; }
            .ciclk { padding: .6rem .75rem; font-size: .92em; }
            .hero { padding: 1.4em; }
            .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="nav">
        <img src="/resources/logo-white.png" alt="TEDxGIIS Logo" id="logopng">
        <div class="nav-right">
            <a href="/" class="ciclk">Home</a>
            <a href="/speakers" class="ciclk">Speakers</a>
            <a href="/team" class="ciclk">Team</a>
            <a href="/registration" class="ciclk active">Registration</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main class="page">
        <section class="hero">
            <h1>Registration Details</h1>
            <p>Share your email address during registration to receive event details and confirmation.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="layout">
            <article class="info-card">
                <h2>Registration Email</h2>
                <p>Please provide your email address in the registration form. Registration details will be sent there.</p>
                <p>Email: tedx@school.edu</p>
            </article>

            <article class="info-card">
                <h2>Contact Us</h2>
                <p>For registration support, contact us at:</p>
                <p>Email: tedx@school.edu</p>
                <p>Phone: +65 XXXX XXXX</p>
            </article>

            <article class="info-card">
                <h2>Event Date &amp; Time</h2>
                <p>5 October 2026</p>
                <p>9:00 AM Singapore Time (SGT)</p>
            </article>
        </section>

        <p class="note">Note: This event is limited to GIIS students only.</p>

        <footer>© 2026 TEDxGIIS Youth. This independent TEDx event is operated under licence from TED.</footer>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
